### Example Code Snippet
Here’s a basic example using Java:
```java
try {
    while (true) {
        ConsumerRecords<String, String> records = consumer.poll(Duration.ofMillis(100));
        for (ConsumerRecord<String, String> record : records) {
            // Process record
        }
        consumer.commitSync();
    }
} catch (Exception e) {
    // Handle exception
} finally {
    consumer.close();
}
```

